2. Cfront 3.0.3 grammar (not included)

convert_yacc.py, test_grammar_io.py and ui_server.py can use the grammar of
AT&T Cfront release 3.0.3 (cfront/gram.y). That file is AT&T proprietary
source code that the Computer History Museum posts for historical research
purposes only, so neither it nor any translation of it is distributed here.
README.md explains how to fetch it for local use.
